{
  "id": "RAW_eea3fb2f56",
  "title": "Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash：速度更快、成本更低，支持生成更长视频片段",
  "url": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-omni-12-flash-fast-and-cost-effective-with-longer-clips/",
  "date": "2026-11-06 01:03:44",
  "author": "Anish Nangia",
  "siteName": "Google DeepMind News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <p>Today, we’re rolling out <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/models/gemini-omni/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini Omni</a> 1.2 Flash, and making it generally available across the <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/docs/omni\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini API</a> and <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/ai-machine-learning/gemini-omni-1-2-flash-generally-available\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini for business</a>. Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash introduces native 15-second video creation, multi-turn conversational editing capabilities, and enhanced reference following. We have dropped the price 30% from Gemini Omni 1.1 making it available at $0.07 per second for 720p video.</p>\n    <p>Here’s an overview of what’s new:</p>\n    <h2>Fast and cost-effective at scale</h2>\n    <p>Beyond the lower price, the workflow keeps costs down: you can draft fast at 360p or 720p, fix a detail with a follow-up edit instead of re-generating the entire clip, and then upscale your best creations to 1080p or 4K.</p>\n    <h2>Longer clips up to 15 seconds</h2>\n    <p>You can now generate and edit videos natively up to 15 seconds long, up from 10 seconds with Omni 1.1. You can also specify duration in one-second increments from 3 to 15 seconds, giving you room to tell complete stories, create product explainers, or produce full social ad spots in a single generation.</p>\n    <h2>Better reference adherence</h2>\n    <p>You can guide generation combining character, product, or style images, short motion clips (up to three seconds), and audio cues — and Omni 1.2 Flash holds onto those details from start to finish. Faces, garments, packaging typography, and brand colors stay consistent across camera angles, making it easy to turn existing product photography or character sheets into virtual try-on clips, catalog spins, and branded video ads.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\">\n   <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full\">\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4\">\n     <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n      <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Combining one model photo with front-and-back product shots of three outfits, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash generates a 15-second virtual try-on sequence across 360-degree turns and match cuts while keeping the model’s identity and each garment’s cut, drape, and back details consistent.\" class=\"uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/video_6113_wagtailvideo-6_qxnhjj.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/ECom_Try_On_Demo.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/ECom_Try_On_Demo.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!</video>\n      <div class=\"uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted\">\n       <button class=\"uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active\" aria-label=\"Play video\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"uni-inline-image__caption\">\n     <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n       <div slot=\"caption-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\">\n         <p>Combining one model photo with front-and-back product shots of three outfits, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash generates a 15-second virtual try-on sequence across 360-degree turns and match cuts while keeping the model’s identity and each garment’s cut, drape, and back details consistent.</p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button\" aria-label=\"More\" aria-expanded=\"false\"> \n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button-icon\"></div> \n     </button>\n    </figcaption>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>More consistent results</h2>\n    <p>You can maintain stronger character, object, and scene consistency from the first to the last frame, with less visual drift or morphing across motion and camera transitions. Whether you’re interpolating between a first and last keyframe, or extending a clip to build a longer sequence, products, characters, props, and environments stay consistent from shot to shot.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\">\n   <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full\">\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4\">\n     <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n      <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Given the same static studio lighting exhibition poster and five-layer animation prompt, Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash does not match the reference image as closely as 1.2 does. Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash builds the poster sequentially layer by layer on the dusty-pink cyclorama  rising the hexagonal plinth, assembling the ribbed glass, warm filament, faceted crystal, and coiled-cord letterforms for HALO, GLOW, and LUMEN, and locking every material, shadow, and typographic detail consistently through the final frame.\" class=\"uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/video_6114_wagtailvideo-971rgvy3.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Typographic_Motion_Graphics_Demo.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Typographic_Motion_Graphics_Demo.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!</video>\n      <div class=\"uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted\">\n       <button class=\"uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active\" aria-label=\"Play video\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"uni-inline-image__caption\">\n     <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n       <div slot=\"caption-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\">\n         <p>Given the same static studio lighting exhibition poster and five-layer animation prompt, Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash does not match the reference image as closely as 1.2 does. Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash builds the poster sequentially layer by layer on the dusty-pink cyclorama rising the hexagonal plinth, assembling the ribbed glass, warm filament, faceted crystal, and coiled-cord letterforms for HALO, GLOW, and LUMEN, and locking every material, shadow, and typographic detail consistently through the final frame.</p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button\" aria-label=\"More\" aria-expanded=\"false\"> \n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button-icon\"></div> \n     </button>\n    </figcaption>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>Easier editing in conversation</h2>\n    <p>You can refine the same clip turn by turn — such as swapping a product or background, changing the lighting or weather, or switching the aspect ratio — instead of starting over from scratch. Multi-turn conversational editing works across full 15-second clips, making it easy to produce ad variants for different audiences and placements without re-briefing or re-generating.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\">\n   <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full\">\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4\">\n     <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n      <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Starting from one generated clip, multi-turn conversational prompts swap the background turn by turn — from a striped pavilion tent to an oak forest, a stable with a white horse, a market fair, and a stone castle — while keeping both characters’ performances, armor reflections, and camera framing intact.\" class=\"uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/video_6115_wagtailvideo-zjccjbp2.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Video_Background_Editing_Demo.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Video_Background_Editing_Demo.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!</video>\n      <div class=\"uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted\">\n       <button class=\"uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active\" aria-label=\"Play video\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"uni-inline-image__caption\">\n     <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n       <div slot=\"caption-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\">\n         <p>Starting from one generated clip, multi-turn conversational prompts swap the background turn by turn — from a striped pavilion tent to an oak forest, a stable with a white horse, a market fair, and a stone castle — while keeping both characters’ performances, armor reflections, and camera framing intact.</p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button\" aria-label=\"More\" aria-expanded=\"false\"> \n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button-icon\"></div> \n     </button>\n    </figcaption>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>More natural speech</h2>\n    <p>You can generate scenes with more fluid, natural-sounding dialogue, clearer lip-sync, and distinct multi-speaker conditioning. This will show up whether you’re directing multi-character dialogue in <a href=\"https://labs.google/fx/tools/flow\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Flow</a>, creating video explainers in <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini for business</a>, or creating polished, pro videos with avatars, music and narration in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/videos/create?usp=blog\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Vids</a>.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\">\n   <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full\">\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4\">\n     <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n      <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Conditioned on one conservatory scene image alongside four character, mouth, and one-second voice references, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash routes each sampled voice to the right character with expressive lip-sync and natural comedic timing across a 15-second animated scene.\" class=\"uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/video_6116_wagtailvideo-bv385sol.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Audio_Reference_Lip_Sync_Demo.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Audio_Reference_Lip_Sync_Demo.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!</video>\n      <div class=\"uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted\">\n       <button class=\"uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active\" aria-label=\"Play video\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"uni-inline-image__caption\">\n     <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n       <div slot=\"caption-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\">\n         <p>Conditioned on one conservatory scene image alongside four character, mouth, and one-second voice references, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash routes each sampled voice to the right character with expressive lip-sync and natural comedic timing across a 15-second animated scene.</p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button\" aria-label=\"More\" aria-expanded=\"false\"> \n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button-icon\"></div> \n     </button>\n    </figcaption>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>More controllable, cinematic look</h2>\n    <p>You can direct complex, continuous camera movements like sweeping FPV flythroughs to dramatic zoom-outs and orbits with significantly fewer unwanted jump cuts, steadier scale, and a more polished, cinematic look.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\">\n   <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full\">\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4\">\n     <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n      <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Guided by two architectural reference photos, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash directs one continuous FPV drone flight across the piazza, through the bronze doors, and up through the Pantheon’s coffered dome to the oculus with zero jump cuts.\" class=\"uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/video_6118_wagtailvideo-2eu26q_v.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"><source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Pantheon_Tour_Demo_FuU0KUh.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Pantheon_Tour_Demo_FuU0KUh.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!</video>\n      <div class=\"uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted\">\n       <button class=\"uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active\" aria-label=\"Play video\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <figcaption class=\"uni-inline-image__caption\">\n     <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n       <div slot=\"caption-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\">\n         <p>Guided by two architectural reference photos, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash directs one continuous FPV drone flight across the piazza, through the bronze doors, and up through the Pantheon’s coffered dome to the oculus with zero jump cuts.</p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button\" aria-label=\"More\" aria-expanded=\"false\"> \n      <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__button-icon\"></div> \n     </button>\n    </figcaption>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>Longer clips with smoother motion and tighter consistency</h2>\n    <p>Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash generates clips up to 15 seconds long that hold references together better than before. You can scroll through to see characters, text, and camera moves stay consistent across longer shots, multiple turns and transitions with no cuts.</p>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page--fullbleed uni-media-carousel-wrapper\">\n   <div role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\"uni-carousel\" aria-label=\"Carousel\">\n    <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport\">\n     <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__container\" role=\"list\" style=\"inset-inline-start: -524.5px; padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px; scroll-padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px;\">\n      <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n       <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n        <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n         <div class=\"uni-quote-media-carousel\"></div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div slot=\"controls\" style=\"display: block;\">\n     <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls-container\">\n      <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls\">\n       <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__arrows\">\n        <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous item\" disabled> \n         <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M15.41 16.59L10.83 12L15.41 7.41L14 6L8 12L14 18L15.41 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n         </svg> \n        </button> <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--next\" aria-label=\"Next item\"> \n         <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <path d=\"M8.59 16.59L13.17 12L8.59 7.41L10 6L16 12L10 18L8.59 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n         </svg> \n        </button>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-bar\"></div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\">\n   <div class=\"rich-text\">\n    <h2>Get started with Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash</h2>\n    <p>While development is ongoing to further improve things like fast sports action, rapid script changes and complex physics, Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash is ideal for businesses, developers, and creators producing videos at scale. You can get started with Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash today as it rolls out across Google’s products and developer platforms:</p>\n    <ul>\n     <li><b>For developers using the Gemini API:</b> Prototype in <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-omni-1.2-flash&amp;utm_source=deepmind.google&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=gdm&amp;utm_content=\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google AI Studio</a>, explore interactive starter apps, and check out the <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/docs/omni\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">developer documentation</a> and <a href=\"https://aistudio.google.com/docs/pricing#gemini-omni-1.2-flash\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">pricing</a>.</li>\n     <li><b>For businesses:</b> Try it in the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/studio/media\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud console</a>, and build enterprise solutions with the <a href=\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/gemini/omni-1-2-flash\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">API</a>.</li>\n     <li><b>For everyone using Google apps:</b> Direct scenes and multi-turn edits in <a href=\"https://labs.google/fx/tools/flow\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Flow</a>, generate 15-second clips at no additional cost in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/videos/create?usp=blog\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Vids</a> with a Google account or Google Workspace subscription, create 15-second videos in the <a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini app</a> (rolling out to Google AI Ultra subscribers), and scale video campaigns in <a href=\"https://ads.google.com/aw/assetstudio\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google Ads</a>.</li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Google DeepMind 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash。这款高性价比视频生成模型支持原生生成 15 秒视频片段、多轮对话式编辑，并能更好地遵循参考素材，服务创作者和企业。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Google DeepMind 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash。这款高性价比视频生成模型支持原生生成 15 秒视频片段、多轮对话式编辑，并能更好地遵循参考素材，服务创作者和企业。",
  "summary": "Google DeepMind 宣布，Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash 已在 Gemini API 和 Google Cloud 平台全面推出。该模型支持原生生成 15 秒视频（此前为 10 秒）、多轮对话式编辑，并能更好地遵循参考素材。720p 视频定价下调 30%，至每秒 $0.07。其主要能力包括跨帧持续追踪角色和物体、以更少的跳切实现电影感运镜、生成自然语音并实现唇形同步，以及制作产品讲解视频、社交媒体广告和品牌内容。用户可以先以较低分辨率生成草稿，再通过后续编辑进行修改，最后将视频升频至 1080p 或 4K。面向企业的功能包括 Provisioned Throughput 和 SynthID 水印。Adobe、Havaianas、Monks、Whering、Figma Weave、STAN、Magnific 和 Resemble AI 等多家行业领军企业已采用这项技术。",
